/* Reserving range 100000-109999 */

/***************
*   Defaults   *
***************/
// Generic, unidentified description
@100000 = ~Wands are 1 1/4 ft. long and slender. They are made of ivory, bone, or wood and are usually tipped with something—metal, crystal, stone, and so on. They are fragile and tend to break easily. Because of this, they are often kept in cases.

Wands are powered by charges, each use costing one or more charges (depending on the item). When a wand runs out of charges, it is consumed and destroyed.

STATISTICS:

Weight: 1~


// Wand of ... prefix
@100001 = ~Wand of %spell_name%~


// Shitty, lazy Wand description template
@100002 = ~%new_name%

STATISTICS:

Weight: 1

%spell_desc%~


// Template for custom wand descriptions
//  Note: some of these variables might have more variables contained within (like duration)
//  Note: %variable_spell_block% is optional and may be omitted if not needed
//  Note: %variable_spell_block% may contain line breaks and additional indentation
//  Note: %variable_spell_block% may contain variable array of stat entries
//      - Damage
//      - Range
//  Drawbacks:
//      - This doesn't work well for summons and their stat blocks
//      - %variable_spell_block% would be complicated to build out
@100003 = ~%flavor_text%

STATISTICS:
%spell_school%

Charge abilities:
– %spell_name%
  – %very_short_description%
  %variable_spell_block%
  Duration: %wand_duration%
  Area of Effect: %area_of_effect%
  Saving Throw: %saving_throw%

Requires:
 9 Intelligence

Weight: 1~
